OL,3,GNEWSAHow does arts university stand out
OL,4,Afrom its peers?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents at an arts university have
OL,7,Fshared why they felt it deserved to be
OL,8,Fnamed as the best of its kind in the
OL,9,FUK.
OL,11,FNorwich University of the Arts (NUA)
OL,12,Fhas been picked as the specialist
OL,13,Funiversity of the year in The Times and
OL,14,FThe Sunday Times' Good University Guide
OL,15,F2027, months after the newspaper
OL,16,Frevealed the city as the best place to
OL,17,Flive in the UK.
OL,19,FJanet Chase, 61, who has just graduated
OL,20,Ffrom a four-year fine art degree, said
OL,21,Fshe felt the university had unlocked
OL,22,Fmany doors to her as a mature student.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
